Electric mobility and renewable energy: Expanding EV production, charging networks, solar installations, wind projects, and energy storage systems creates demand for reliable power semiconductor components. Manufacturers can pursue opportunities by developing products tailored to specific voltage, current, and operating requirements.

The market's future development will depend on how effectively suppliers balance switching performance, production cost, reliability, and competition from alternative technologies. Companies that invest in advanced packaging, application engineering, and automotive-grade quality systems can strengthen their position in growing end-use markets.

